; VGM Analyzer MML for OPNAvoid (PMD-style dialect), tick-exact
; Source: 48 Jingle 4 (Shock).vgz
; YM2203 FM/SSG on the song's own Timer B ticks: T140 = 74.713 BPM, 24 ticks per quarter (T estimated from write timing).
; Pitch = PMD note + D detune; volume changes inside notes are tied pieces (FM V, SSG v).
; Vibrato that PMD's own LFO reproduces is written as M/*1, other pitch movement as per-tick D.
; Mixed for OPNAvoid's player: FM 19 TL steps down, rhythm master 4 steps down, SSG v on its 3 dB curve.
; Not reproduced: hardware LFO, SSG hardware envelope, operator changes other than carrier TL.
; OPNAvoid compatibility does not imply compatibility with every PMD compiler.
